# This project builds the CRA app only. Everything below is either a separate
# deployment target or working data that must never reach a build.
#
# Without this, `vercel deploy` uploaded 742 MB — migration/data/ alone is
# 633 MB of exported listing JSONL. .gitignore is not consulted by the CLI.

# Firestore -> Postgres migration tooling and its exported data
migration/

# The Next.js price-guide app builds in its OWN Vercel project (benchlot-web),
# but this file cannot exclude `web/` — Vercel reads .vercelignore from the
# REPOSITORY ROOT regardless of a project's Root Directory setting, so a `web/`
# line strips the app out of its own build ("No Next.js version detected").
# Learned by doing exactly that on 2026-09-01.
#
# Excluding the build artifacts gets the size win anyway: node_modules and
# .next are 781 MB between them, while web/'s tracked source is 476 KB.
web/node_modules/
web/.next/

# Firebase Cloud Functions: deployed via the Firebase CLI, not Vercel
functions/

# Local build output
build/

# Design handoffs and reference documents
design_handoff*/
*.pdf
